, 5, 6, 8–13).\n- Later, starting at **Frame 18**, he appears in **Outfit 2** (beige jacket, blue jeans), and remains in this outfit through Frame 28.\n- There is no evidence of a third distinct outfit combination in any other frame.\n\n---\n\n### **Conclusion:**\n✅ The American man has worn **exactly 2 different outfits** in the video, satisfying all criteria.\n\n**Answer: 2 — Correct.**'}, {'batch_start': 90, 'batch_end': 120, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3525.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3526.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3527.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3528.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3529.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3530.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3531.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3532.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3533.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3712.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3713.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3714.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3715.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3716.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3717.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3718.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3719.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3720.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3721.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3722.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_p