ct outfit** across all frames where he appears.\n\n❌ Therefore, the answer **‘2’ is incorrect**.\n\n**Correct Answer: 1**\n\n---\n\n### Additional Notes:\n\n- The global summary mentions a “man wearing a red bandana and a light blue or gray shirt” — this may be a misdescription. In the frames, he is wearing a **green shirt under a beige jacket**, not a light blue or gray shirt.\n- No second outfit (e.g., different jacket, shirt, or pants) is visible in any frame.\n- Even in different settings (mountain restaurant, indoor home scene), his clothing remains unchanged.\n\n---\n\n**Final Answer: The correct number of different outfits worn by the American man is 1. The answer ‘2’ is false.**'}, {'batch_start': 120, 'batch_end': 150, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3805.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3874.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3875.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3876.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3877.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3878.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3879.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3880.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3881.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3882.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3883.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3884.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3990.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3991.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3992.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_3993.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_