 shirt, dark pants — clearly distinct.\n- **Conclusion:** This is **Outfit 1**.\n\n#### **Outfit 2: Light Beige Jacket + Light Blue Shirt + Dark Pants (Outdoor Setting)**\n- **Frames:** 29\n- **Description:** The man is outdoors, wearing the *same* light beige jacket, but now over a **light blue collared shirt** (not green). He is still wearing dark pants.\n- **Visual Characteristics:** Same jacket, but different inner shirt color (blue vs. green) — this constitutes a *visibly different combination* of top clothing.\n- **Conclusion:** This is **Outfit 2**.\n\n#### **Frames 2, 3, 4, 12, 20–23, 28, 30:**\n- **Frame 2, 3, 4:** Only show a person’s torso/hands — **not the American man** (no red bandana visible, different clothing — gray puffer jacket).\n- **Frame 12, 20–23:** Show a woman and/or another person — **American man not visible**.\n- **Frame 28:** American man is visible from behind/side — **wearing the same beige jacket and blue shirt as Frame 29**, but **pants are not clearly visible**. Since we cannot confirm the bottom garment, we **cannot count this as a complete outfit** per criteria #2.\n- **Frame 30:** Shows two local men butchering meat — **American man is NOT present**.\n\n---\n\n### Final Tally:\n- **Outfit 1:** Beige jacket + green shirt + dark pants → **Confirmed in multiple frames**.\n- **Outfit 2:** Beige jacket + light blue shirt + dark pants → **Confirmed in Frame 29** (pants visible).\n\n> ✅ **Total distinct outfits = 2**\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Answer: **2 is correct.**\n\nThe American man has worn **two different outfits** in the video, meeting all specified criteria.'}, {'batch_start': 150, 'batch_end': 180, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_4303.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_4304.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_4305.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_4306.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/v